1420: 
1421: Trainable parameters are counted directly from tensors that require gradients. Stage~1 wall time includes fitting, validation, and checkpointing. It is treated as a descriptive single-run cost because early stopping and variation in the hosted environment affect duration. For Stage~2 timing, gradients are disabled and the model is placed in evaluation mode. Per-flow latency is calculated as
