1457: 
1458: Unless explicitly qualified, F1, precision, and recall refer to macro averages; class-1 quantities carry a separate label. Discussion centres on macro-F1, PR-AUC, class-1 performance, FP, FN, and FPR because the majority class dominates accuracy. Numerical differences are interpreted only when the models share a test manifest.
