1463: \subsection{Architecture and Temporal-Encoding Effects}
1464: \label{subsubsec:results_stage1_models}
1465: 
1466: Stage~1 model families and encoding ablations are contrasted on a common flow test set in Figure~\ref{fig:results_stage1_models}; their parameter counts and training times appear in Table~\ref{tab:results_stage1_errors_efficiency}.
1467: 
1468: \begin{figure}[H]
1469:     \centering
1470:     \includegraphics[width=\textwidth]{\resultsfigurepath/stage1_model_comparison.pdf}
1471:     \caption{Stage~1 architecture and encoding comparison on the common flow test manifest. The horizontal axis begins at 0.52, and absolute values are printed at the end of each bar.}
