1523: The fusion comparison in Figure~\ref{fig:results_stage1_fusion} uses one shared flow manifest. Scheme~A tiles the statistical vector across packet tokens, Scheme~B retains packet inputs alone, and Scheme~C conditions packet representations through bounded token-FiLM from a separate branch.
