1761:One extension is a causal pool containing source-host, destination-host, endpoint, protocol, service, subnet, and temporal-neighbour relations. Relation identity could enter through learned embeddings or attention biases; alternatively, separate key--value projections could be combined by a target-conditioned gate. In both cases, eligibility should be limited to embeddings available at decision time, enforced through flow-end or embedding-availability timestamps rather than start order alone. The horizon might also adapt to traffic density by selecting between duration-based and flow-count windows.
